---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" active="/aboutus">
  <section class="pagebanner">
    <img class="banner-img" src="/banner-about.webp" alt="Steel stockyard aisle with racked bars and pipes" />
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">About Bhansali Metals</p>
      <h1>A practical partner for industrial metal supply.</h1>
      <p>We support domestic and international customers with a focused materials range and technically clear enquiries.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell intro">
      <div>
        <h2>Built around responsive, relevant supply.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Bhansali Metals is positioned around stainless steel, high-nickel alloys, pipe fittings, flanges, bars and flat products for industrial use.</p>
        <p>Our role is to make sourcing clearer: understand the product requirement, confirm the right details, and support the next stage of the project.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div><b>Location</b><span>Mumbai, India</span></div>
          <div><b>Supply model</b><span>Domestic & export</span></div>
          <div><b>Focus</b><span>Industrial materials</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="shell productcontent">
      <aside>Bhansali Metals<br />Company record</aside>
      <div>
        <h2>35+ years behind every heat.</h2>
        <p>One of the leading manufacturers, exporters and domestic suppliers of stainless black bars, forged bars, bright bars, hex/square bars and wire rods — and authorised Mukand Ltd dealer for black bars, wire rods, billets and blooms in 300, 200 and 400 series plus duplex.</p>
        <div class="details">
          <div><b>Capacity</b><span>30,000 TPA with in-house casting, machining and QC laboratory</span></div>
          <div><b>Documentation</b><span>MTC per heat, gate-pass paperwork, BV / SGS / TÜV / DNV inspection hosted</span></div>
          <div><b>Mission</b><span>Technically sound solutions that make us the preferred Fitting & Flanges manufacturer</span></div>
          <div><b>Customers</b><span>Govt., semi-govt., public and private sectors, domestic and export</span></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="button" href="/enquiry">Request a quote ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="shell productcontent">
      <aside>Bhansali Metals<br />Vision · Mission · Values</aside>
      <div>
        <h2>What we stand on.</h2>
        <h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Our Vision</h3>
        <p>Bhansali Metals understands that business value cannot be achieved through technology alone. It starts with people: experts working together to get to the heart of your individual business objectives and develop the most adapted solutions to fit these requirements. We believe this human-centered approach to technology is what makes the difference for your business.</p>
        <p>Bhansali Metals is committed to being a responsible corporate and our vision is to be the global steel industry benchmark for value creation and corporate citizenship.</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Our Mission</h3>
        <p>Bhansali Metals enables you to transform your organization and improve performance. We aim to empower you to respond more quickly and intuitively to changing market dynamics. By bolstering your ability to harness the right Metals World, we help you become more agile and competitive. Provide technically sound solutions and create additional value in mutual interest with our customers resulting in being a preferred manufacturer within the Fitting & Flanges sector.</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Our Values</h3>
        <p>Bhansali Metals people are:–<br />· Safe<br />· Ethical<br />· Innovative<br />· Responsive<br />· Quality and cost conscious<br />· Driven to deliver</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Why Bhansali Metals</h3>
        <p>One of our proudest achievements as a company is our growing repetitive customer base. We have been fortunate to team with some outstanding companies and have earned the trust and repeat business with a number of them. It is our desire to impress our customers and keep them coming back, along with providing the service they require and allowing the continued growth of Bhansali Metals. We strive to provide each and every customer.</p>
        <p><strong>Our key elements:–</strong><br />· Supply Globally<br />· Timely delivery<br />· Superior quality products<br />· Constant improvement in quality and designs</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
